From 0a17383c8ae02c6e57ef489e35a9c04ac0a7d8ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:46:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Onboarding, approval switches and notifications for every
 update

Approvals (Sync Settings > Approvals, System Manager):
- Require business approval: a business created by a GST User is Pending until
  approved in Frappe (Business > Approve / Reject; approve_business,
  reject_business, get_pending_approvals); its GSTINs stay inactive and can't
  request an OTP until then. Staff-created businesses are approved.
- Require GSTIN approval (on by default): off = a verified GSTIN is active at once.
- get_clients / get_businesses / create_business return approval.

Notifications (App Notification; new kinds approval, account, business,
payment, document; the person who made the change is left out):
- notices (created, sync found new, AI analysis ready, review corrections),
  review item confirmed, payment recorded, document uploaded / retagged,
  business approved / rejected / waiting, onboarding stage, GSTIN added,
  connected, consent expired, session ended, GST User welcome / business added /
  name changed, practice profile updated / renamed.
- Daily 08:30 job: reply due (per user's reminder days, default 7,3,1), due
  today, overdue (day 1 then weekly), short reply window, consent expiring
  (30/7/1 days) and expiry, morning digest, consultant copies.

Onboarding:
- LitWatch Lead (source, status New/Hold/Rejected/Onboard, collected on, user
  link; Data Import for Excel) with Convert to User.
- Account email (set-password link + app URL) when a GST User is created.
- Registration Invite (one-time token link, email or copied to WhatsApp) and
  guest APIs get_registration_invite / register (rate limited).
- Patch onboarding_approvals_defaults; tests test_onboarding_approvals.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
